# Ingest CSVs to S3 → trigger Lambda → load to DynamoDB
# Tools: Terraform, S3, Lambda, DynamoDB

# Flow: 
1.Upload file to input/ in S3
2.Lambda triggered → parses CSV → writes records to DynamoDB
3.Terraform manages all infra

resources:
- aws_s3_bucket, aws_lambda_function, aws_dynamodb_table
- EventBridge S3 triggers in Terraform